    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-object GOT and PLT Stub builder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constructs GOT entries and PLT stubs in every graph for referenced symbols. Building these blocks in every graph is likely to lead to duplicate entries in the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_j_i_t_link_dylib" kindref="compound">JITLinkDylib</ref>, but allows graphs to be trivially removed independently without affecting other graphs (since those other graphs will have their own copies of any required entries). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
